  "id": "devcontainer-builder-image",
  "generatedAt": "2026-10-10T02:44:49.480Z",
  "title": "Devcontainer builder image: agents, hooks, and the git wrapper",
  "summary": "This change turns the devcontainer from a bare Rust image into a full builder environment. It pins and installs moon, Node 22, pnpm, Bun, gh, actionlint, uv, the NVIDIA skill linters, and four coding agents (codex, claude-code, opencode, omp), then wires each agent's own hook files to `osf hook` so prompt and stop events reach the factory. The git wrapper is rewritten to force the hooks path per-invocation under the workspace instead of setting a system-wide core.hooksPath, and a battery of build-time tests now proves the wrapper's refusals, the hook wiring, the toolchain's read-only-ness, and that dsh boots on both profiles.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
